OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering overnight rain,
OL,6,Fdrizzle and stronger winds soon
OL,7,Fclearing Shetland. Otherwise a dry day
OL,8,Fwith variable cloud and some bright
OL,9,Fspells, feeling cool in the northerly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy overnight with
OL,13,Fa light breeze, cloud thickening
OL,14,Ftowards dawn for Orkney with a few
OL,15,Fspots of rain here, a brighter start
OL,16,Ffor Shetland and Fair Isle.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA dry and bright day for
OL,19,FShetland but cloud and some patchy
OL,20,Frain at times for Orkney, light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
